Open drift reconcile PR updating OpenSLO YAML in Git.

Target `${repository_full_name}` @ `${base_branch}`.

1. Set branch_prefix=`aiden/slo-drift-reconcile` in notes.
2. Spawn **open-slo-pr-runner** (one execute_series).
3. PR body must list each drift item with evidence (alert UID, dashboard panel).
4. Mirror `pr_url=` / `pr_blocker=` tokens.
